			TeachingProjectileC_BloomGlowCore.DisplayName: 教学弹幕C绽放辉光核心
			TeachingProjectileD_PulseRingField.DisplayName: 教学弹幕D脉冲环场
			TeachingProjectileE_ExplosionImpact.DisplayName: 教学弹幕E爆炸冲击
