			TeachingProjectileJ_DebrisMechanicalParts.DisplayName: 教学弹幕J机械碎片
			TeachingProjectileK_MagicStatusUI.DisplayName: 教学弹幕K魔法状态界面
			TeachingProjectileL_SlashSmearAfterimage.DisplayName: 教学弹幕L斩击残影拖痕
			TeachingProjectileM_TechHoloSquare.DisplayName: 教学弹幕M科技全息方块
			TeachingProjectileN_ParticleSetsControllers.DisplayName: 教学弹幕N粒子组控制器
